{
  "id": "p47",
  "title": "The Clinic and the Bank Proposal",
  "titleZh": "诊所与银行提案",
  "topic": "社区法律援助与银行私有化",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My aunt's small clinic offers support on immigration cases.",
        "zh": "我姑姑的小诊所为移民案件提供支持。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young lawyer handles each affair with care and respect.",
        "zh": "一位年轻律师谨慎而尊重地处理每一件事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their calm approach helps settle most problems before night.",
        "zh": "他们冷静的做法帮助大多数问题在入夜前解决。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The studio upstairs records short interviews for the local media.",
        "zh": "楼上的工作室为本地媒体录制简短的采访。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An official from the ministry visits the clinic each month.",
        "zh": "一位部里的官员每月来诊所一次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She checks every category of welfare claim with care.",
        "zh": "她仔细核对福利申请的每一个类别。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A consultant helps them secure a small financial grant.",
        "zh": "一位顾问帮他们争取到一小笔财政补助。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They establish a clear root cause list for each case.",
        "zh": "他们为每个案件建立一份清楚的根源清单。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An adequate plan can stretch a small budget through winter.",
        "zh": "一份足够的计划能让小预算撑过冬天。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My team's pace is slow, but every member stays capable.",
        "zh": "我团队的节奏很慢，但每个成员都保持能干。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "One violent case sends a frightened family into a shelter.",
        "zh": "一起暴力案件把一个受惊的家庭送进了收容所。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A trap in the wording fools even a careful reader.",
        "zh": "措辞里的一个陷阱甚至骗过细心的读者。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The ambassador's office becomes a useful contact for the clinic.",
        "zh": "大使办公室成了诊所一个有用的人脉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The clinic's membership grows as word spreads overseas.",
        "zh": "随着消息传到海外，诊所的会员人数增加。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A short report discloses a gross error in the accounts.",
        "zh": "一份简短报告披露了账目中的重大错误。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A moderate group proposes to privatize the local banking service.",
        "zh": "一个温和的团体提议将本地银行业私有化。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The opposition calls the plan odd and deeply unfair.",
        "zh": "反对派称这项计划古怪且极不公平。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A public assembly gives every resident a real stake.",
        "zh": "一次公开集会给了每位居民真正的利害关系。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They opt for a careful path and wait for a clear cue.",
        "zh": "他们选择一条谨慎的路，等待明确的提示。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A leap in costs would otherwise leave families without help.",
        "zh": "成本的跃升否则会让许多家庭得不到帮助。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Few residents can solve the initial puzzle of the new forms.",
        "zh": "很少有居民能独自解开新表格最初的谜题。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then such cases tend to raise a relevant question about fairness.",
        "zh": "那么这类案件往往会提出一个关于公平的相关问题。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A new report describes abuse against a very vulnerable tenant.",
        "zh": "一份新报告描述了针对一名非常脆弱租户的虐待。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin helps load the files and strengthen each weak point.",
        "zh": "我表弟帮忙装载文件，并加强每个薄弱环节。"
      },
      {
        "en": "No automatic system can cover this whole universe of needs.",
        "zh": "没有任何自动系统能覆盖这整个需求世界。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the final proposal draws a critical reply from the council.",
        "zh": "后来最终提案引来议会严厉的回复。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the long review, the old fabric is definitely beyond repair.",
        "zh": "在漫长的审查期间，这座建筑的旧结构肯定已无法修复。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The clinic marks its eightieth year under a new and calm presidency.",
        "zh": "诊所在新的、平静的主席任期下迎来第八十周年。"
      }
    ]
  ],
